{
  "id": "E268",
  "title": "My Sister is Sitting the Month",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-10-27",
  "synopsis": "Lili says her older sister is “sitting the month”. What does it mean?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/877/4f0e09841699bb16b54e2e87c9cb1ac8d9526cf9.mp3?1539497956",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我的姐姐在坐月子\n\n本：丽丽，你要去哪儿？\n丽丽：我要去看我的姐姐。她在坐月子呢。\n本：月子是什么？为什么要坐在上面呢？\n丽丽：“坐月子”是说女人生孩子以后要在家休息一个月。这是中国人的传统习俗。",
    "traditional": "我的姐姐在坐月子\n\n本：麗麗，你要去哪兒？\n麗麗：我要去看我的姐姐。她在坐月子呢。\n本：月子是什麼？為什麼要坐在上面呢？\n麗麗：“坐月子”是說女人生孩子以後要在家休息一個月。這是中國人的傳統習俗。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My Sister is Sitting the Month"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，你要去哪儿？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，你要去哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì nǐ yào qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我要去看我的姐姐。她在坐月子呢。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我要去看我的姐姐。她在坐月子呢。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ yào qù kàn wǒ de jiě jie tā zài zuò yuè zi ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili:  I’m going to visit my older sister. She’s in postpartum confinement now."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：月子是什么？为什么要坐在上面呢？",
      "traditional": "本：月子是什麼？為什麼要坐在上面呢？",
      "pinyin": "běn yuè zi shì shén me wèi shén me yào zuò zài shàng miàn ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What is “yuezi”? Why does she have to sit on it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：“坐月子”是说女人生孩子以后要在家休息一个月。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：“坐月子”是說女人生孩子以後要在家休息一個月。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zuò yuè zi shì shuō nǚ rén shēng hái zi yǐ hòu yào zài jiā xiū xi yí ge yuè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "这是中国人的传统习俗。",
      "traditional": "這是中國人的傳統習俗。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì zhōng guó rén de chuán tǒng xí sú",
      "english": "Lili: \"Sitting the month\" means that a woman must rest at home for one month after giving birth."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is a Chinese tradition."
    }
  ],
